WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.895
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02.165 --> 00:03.218
Hurry!

3
00:03.218 --> 00:04.221
[Baggage Keeping Area]

4
00:34.000 --> 00:35.875
Looks like he hasn't gone far.

5
00:35.875 --> 00:37.541
We must find him as soon as possible

6
00:37.541 --> 00:39.416
and bring him back for the experiment.

7
02:48.683 --> 02:53.399
[Apocalypse Log 11]

8
02:54.709 --> 02:57.551
[Baggage Keeping Area]

9
03:10.916 --> 03:13.291
They're looking for someone.

10
03:16.458 --> 03:18.875
They're looking for you.

11
03:25.458 --> 03:27.833
Why are they looking for you?

12
03:29.125 --> 03:31.500
They're from Casia.

13
03:34.458 --> 03:35.625
After the apocalypse,

14
03:35.625 --> 03:38.416
they forced me to research the zombie virus.

15
03:38.416 --> 03:40.166
I barely managed to escape.

16
03:40.166 --> 03:42.833
I don't want to be captured by them again.

17
03:42.833 --> 03:45.416
You research the zombie virus?

18
03:47.833 --> 03:49.208
They're still nearby.

19
03:49.208 --> 03:51.916
Let's talk later.

20
03:51.916 --> 03:55.750
Since there's no fuel at T1, why don't we check T2?

21
04:00.958 --> 04:02.458
Let's go.

22
04:22.708 --> 04:23.833
Looking at the path we've taken,

23
04:23.833 --> 04:26.416
it doesn't look like anyone's lived here.

24
04:30.458 --> 04:32.625
But don't worry.

25
04:32.625 --> 04:36.458
Your brother most likely took refuge somewhere else.

26
04:38.541 --> 04:39.750
Let's find fuel first.

27
04:39.750 --> 04:41.125
We can leave once we find it.

28
04:41.125 --> 04:43.583
I'll look for him elsewhere, too.

29
05:12.625 --> 05:16.458
He, you said it's all the same after the apocalypse.

30
05:16.458 --> 05:18.250
What did you mean?

31
05:21.125 --> 05:24.041
After the apocalypse, Casia partnered with armed groups.

32
05:24.041 --> 05:25.666
They provide protection,

33
05:25.666 --> 05:29.541
but they also keep the lab locked down like a fortress.

34
05:29.541 --> 05:30.792
People like me

35
05:30.792 --> 05:32.708
are no different from high-profile prisoners.

36
05:32.708 --> 05:37.000
The research direction isn't for us to decide.

37
05:37.000 --> 05:39.541
Has there been any actual progress?

38
05:46.250 --> 05:48.375
There are some theoretical models.

39
05:48.375 --> 05:52.916
But as for a real antibody, we're still a long way off.

40
05:56.041 --> 05:57.916
Did you find it?

41
05:59.205 --> 06:01.080
Nothing here.

42
06:01.913 --> 06:03.871
I'll check over there.

43
06:11.788 --> 06:14.830
Keep it down, or you'll attract zombies.

44
06:14.830 --> 06:18.121
What's there to fear? It'll be good practice.

45
06:37.542 --> 06:39.830
He Yao.

46
06:39.830 --> 06:41.621
Let's go.

47
07:07.110 --> 07:08.918
Lie, run!

48
08:43.705 --> 08:46.038
Are you okay?

49
08:46.038 --> 08:47.830
I'm fine.

50
09:28.080 --> 09:29.580
There are two more people over there.

51
09:29.580 --> 09:31.371
Wait for me here.

52
10:17.163 --> 10:18.955
Let's go.

53
11:12.708 --> 11:14.542
He Yao, that bastard.

54
11:14.542 --> 11:17.038
So, he wanted to steal our car.

55
11:17.038 --> 11:19.538
Let's get out of this airport first.

56
12:09.121 --> 12:10.705
It's okay.

57
12:10.705 --> 12:12.871
You're safe now.

58
12:19.580 --> 12:21.871
It's all right now.

59
12:39.913 --> 12:42.246
Where are we?

60
12:42.246 --> 12:44.080
In the car.

61
12:47.871 --> 12:51.288
I'm not so far gone that I can't recognize a car.

62
12:51.288 --> 12:53.621
I mean...

63
12:53.621 --> 12:55.955
Where are you taking me?

64
12:57.663 --> 13:00.413
To find a place to settle you in.

65
13:00.413 --> 13:02.246
Then we'll figure something out.

66
13:09.788 --> 13:12.413
Don't feed me your blood ever again.

67
13:13.375 --> 13:15.166
He Yao.

68
13:16.246 --> 13:18.830
You still won't give up?

69
13:19.580 --> 13:21.787
I will never give up.

70
13:21.787 --> 13:22.833
Not until I'm dead.

71
13:22.833 --> 13:24.830
I'm the one who's dead.

72
13:24.830 --> 13:26.958
Haven't you faced reality yet?

73
13:26.958 --> 13:28.621
You're not like them.

74
13:28.621 --> 13:30.913
You're just sick.

75
13:33.292 --> 13:35.455
He Yao.

76
13:35.455 --> 13:37.788
Don't try to cure me...

77
13:37.788 --> 13:40.371
just to prove that you're better than me.

78
13:40.371 --> 13:42.830
I admit defeat, okay?

79
13:46.417 --> 13:47.958
Then the loser should listen to the winner.

80
13:47.958 --> 13:49.621
I'm a zombie.

81
13:49.621 --> 13:51.833
I could bite you at any moment.

82
13:51.833 --> 13:56.205
Why do you insist on staying with a living dead like me?

83
13:56.205 --> 13:58.246
Drop your damn competitive streak.

84
13:58.246 --> 14:01.038
I'm not the competitive one here.

85
14:01.038 --> 14:02.538
You're the one who wanted to beat me...

86
14:02.538 --> 14:05.996
so you experimented on yourself and ended up like this.

87
14:05.996 --> 14:08.375
This was my own choice.

88
14:08.375 --> 14:10.621
I'll bear the consequences.

89
14:10.621 --> 14:13.458
It has nothing to do with you.

90
14:13.458 --> 14:15.928
Well, this is my choice.

91
14:15.928 --> 14:18.345
And I'll bear it myself.

92
14:19.204 --> 14:21.246
You're crazy.

93
14:23.083 --> 14:25.333
I've been fucking crazy for a long time.

94
14:30.954 --> 14:32.663
Fine.

95
15:17.329 --> 15:18.871
Lie.

96
15:20.996 --> 15:22.996
You have a fever.
